WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:06.300
Every business has data. The opportunity is turning it into action.

00:06.300 --> 00:09.800
This is Agentic BI, built and led by Eric Wu.

00:09.800 --> 00:12.000
Start with O2O performance.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.300
Ask AI to connect the signals and suggest a focused next step.

00:16.300 --> 00:21.200
Turn insight into an execution plan, with a named owner and a review date.

00:21.200 --> 00:25.200
Then bring execution history back into the conversation.

00:25.200 --> 00:28.500
Review progress. Surface gaps. Decide what happens next.

00:28.500 --> 00:33.500
Original workflows, demonstrated with synthetic data and scripted AI responses.
